|trivia = 
*When an enemy marked with "Dragon" is defeated, all subsequent enemies that aren't marked become marked with "Prey". There is no additional effect for defeating enemies marked with "Prey" however, because its considered a Marked effect, it benefits from the Damage increase from her Passive effect.
*When starting battle against a singular enemy, they will have all 3 markers applied to them. If multiple enemies are present, they will be applied randomly according to the Passive's conditions. These marks and their effects can only be applied and acquired once.
*Beowulf is the only Doll whose [[Oath]] dialogues involve her refusing the oath and not displaying any hint of intimacy.
